The 30, another: "The child is fine, he goes to the summer hours to learn Catalan.
On Víctor, his current partner, there is one: "He advances me money".
On the Internet she has messages in blogs dedicated to animation and manga.
She had one of her own in the MySpace universe, now blocked, where her name was "Muki the liberator of the prison."
"Terror to the Galician (epigraph)."
The last man who lived with her, vigile, declares his regret to feel guilty.
He doesn’t want to think that everything went by so she didn’t tell him that she was a single mother.
Mónica entered the Palma Provincial Prison yesterday from the Menorca Judicial Inmates Centre.
Lawyer Carlos Maceda explained that she doesn’t remember how the facts happened, “and she didn’t intend to hurt the minor either.”
Before she had confessed to drowning Caesar in the bathtub and laid her corpse in a suitcase.
The defense and the prosecutor requested a psychiatric test.
The members of the People's Party would win 4 seats in Congress and the PSC would lose 9
With the results of the 18-N, the PP could be decisive in the municiples of Lerida, Tarragona and Barcelona.
After the significant increase in votes and deputies recorded in the last autonomous elections, the Catalan PP has already targeted the generals because, even if there is progress or not, the prospects are more than positive, because the number of votes that this party obtains in these comics normally doubles the one it receives in the Catalans.
For example, the Catalan people obtained 610,473 votes to the generals of 2008, while at the autonomics of 2006, they had obtained 316.222.
Last Sunday, the CPP received 384.091 votes.
If we maintain this bottom-up trend, desired by a misappropriation of PSC votes and the loyalty of the PP electorate, the analysts of this party have calculated the fact that, if there would be a general election, the PPC could increase from 8 to 12 deputies in Congress, while CiU would also win four (it now has 10) and PSC would lose neither less nor less than 9 deputies
These calculations would find that the Catalan place is fundamental for PP and PSOE.
According to the analysis of the popular, ERC would lose a Member of Parliament - he has three now - while ICV would keep a Member of Parliament or gain one.
But if the electoral agenda continues, the next meeting would take place in May of 2011 for municipal comics, where people can also be decisive at the end of socialist hegemony in the four provincial capitals and in their relay at the head of the General Council of Barcelona, one of the administrations that manipulates the higher budget - 661 million euros for 2011-.
Both nationalists and people agree that PSC could lose the town halls of Barcelona, Tarragona, Lerida and Gerona, where the socialists would also not get the majority the opportunity to use their traditional partners, ERC and ICV.
Taking into account the republican debacle, it would not be whimsical that this formation loses its representation in the town hall of Barcelona - it is necessary to get the 5% of the votes -.
The PP has increased its voting number in the four capitals and could be a decisive force in Barcelona, Lerida and Tarragona.
The nationalists are convinced that they can be the protagonists of the fall in the capital of Tarragona, where they ruled with the PP before the current socialist mayor, Josep Félix Ballesteros.
In Lerida, the PP recorded only a difference of 500 votes compared to PSC, whose mayor, Àngel Ros, maintains very good relations with Mariano Rajoy - during this last campaign, they met several times.
People have also made progress in other important municipalities such as Badalona, Castelldefels or Reus.
At present, the PP is present in 34 municipal governments in Catalonia and aspires to form lists in a maximum number of localities.
The Catalan cell has facilitated thousands of passports to Al Qaeda
Apart from the seven inmates in Barcelona, Thailand there were three
The seven Pakistanis and the Nigerien held by agents of the General Information Police of the Barcelona Police formed a jihadist cell which, directed from Thailand, facilitated passports to various Al Qaeda groups, between which "The Tigers for the Liberation of the Earth Tamil" (LTTE) and "Laskar e Taiba" (Let), the last being the perpetrator of the Bombay attacks that caused the death
The Ministry of Interns has given great importance to these investigations, to the point of ensuring that with "Operation Kampai" has "been debilited" Al Qaeda's forgerying apparatus on an international level and "therefore, its operating capacity".
Investigators calculate that the cell, in the two years it was active in Catalonia, was able to sent thousands of passports to Thailand, or they were falsified and then distributed to groups that integrated the criminal galaxy Al Qaeda so that its "combatants" could pass through European borders and other Western countries with complete impunity.
The dismantled cell is the only one that the jihadist network held operating in Europe, which is why, apart from the Thai services, other European police units participated, apart from other European police units, which is why in the territory of the European Union there could be blows in the following days similar to that recorded the night of last Tuesday in Barcelona.
In coordination with this operation (Pakista's Junaid Humayun, Atiqur Rehman, Jabran Asghar, Malik Iftikhar Ahmad, Mohammad Saddique Khan Begum, Tanveer Arshad and Nigerian Babatunde Agunbiades were detained), in Thailand there was another, with the capture of Pakistan's Muhammad Athar Butt and Zeeshan Eh
They were those who ruled from Bangkok the cell implanted in Spain and other European countries.
The Catalan network - part of which was hit in 2009 - was mainly stealing from tourists the passports that satisfied the conditions marked by the named "World Islamic Front".
That is, the documents had to be in the name of young men aged between 25 and 45 years old, with a validity of several years and without stamped visas.
Investigators point out that so far no details have been found that connects detainees in Catalonia with the Bombay attack, even though the perpetrator of this attack, "Laskar e Taiba", has been one of the receiving groups of passports stolen in Spain and then falsified in Thailand.
Nevertheless we must recall the fact that a few days before this attack was committed, from Catalunya we sent through a transfer agency a few thousand dollars that were "invested" to buy mobile cards that were used after by the integrals of the "commando" that killed 106 people.
The police seized extensive documentation.
PP asks Mas to suspend fiscal complicity
